    "body": "```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n($status )$character\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"$❯\"\r\nerror_symbol = \"[$❯](red)\"\r\nvicmd_symbol = \"[$❯](yellow)\"\r\n\r\n[status]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nsymbol = \"X\"\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"Y\"\r\nformat = \"[$symbol]($style)\"\r\npipestatus_separator = \" | \"\r\npipestatus_format = \"\\\\[ $pipestatus \\\\] = [$symbol]($style)\"\r\nmap_symbol = true\r\npipestatus = true\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Actual\r\n```\r\n$❯ Y > true | true\r\n\r\n[ Y | Y ] = Y >\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$❯ true | false\r\n\r\n[ Y | X ] = X >\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$❯ false | true\r\n\r\n[ X | Y ] = Y >\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Expected:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$❯ Y > true | true\r\n\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
